   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Per-run generator health (drops, ticks, achieved rate, send-lag p99, early sends, record completeness) is computed **offline** from the run directory (`benchctl check`, `health.json`), and reconciliation by message ID is `benchctl reconcile`. Neither is in Prometheus. Raw records: `results/runs/<run_id>/` on ramonavm1.\n\n**Unavailable:** sink receipts, qualified cross-host clock offset, history audit. **Unavailable: producer not implemented yet.** This panel stays empty on purpose; nothing here is derived from other metrics. See `docs/tooling-interfaces.md`."
